# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions for the latest version of Operator backpropagation (OBP)"
msgstr "Petunjuk instalasi untuk versi terbaru Operator backpropagation (OBP)"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions"
msgstr "Petunjuk instalasi"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions {#installation-instructions}"
msgstr "Petunjuk instalasi {#installation-instructions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before installing the package, choose how you’re going to run and install the packages. There are two primary ways to do this:\n"
msgstr "Sebelum menginstal package, pilih dulu bagaimana kamu akan menjalankan dan menginstal package. Ada dua cara utama:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Option 1: Install from PyPI](#option-1)\n"
msgstr "[Opsi 1: Instal dari PyPI](#option-1)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Option 2: Install from source](#option-2)\n"
msgstr "[Opsi 2: Instal dari source](#option-2)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Preinstallation {#preinstallation}"
msgstr "Pra-instalasi {#preinstallation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it. We recommend using [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html).\n"
msgstr "Pertama, buat environment minimal yang hanya berisi Python. Kami menyarankan memakai [Python virtual environment](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "Aktifkan environment barumu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note: If you are using Windows, use the following commands in PowerShell:\n"
msgstr "Catatan: Kalau kamu memakai Windows, gunakan perintah berikut di PowerShell:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"option-1\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option 1: Install from PyPI {#option-1-install-from-pypi}"
msgstr "Opsi 1: Instal dari PyPI {#option-1-install-from-pypi}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The most straightforward way to install the `qiskit-addon-obp` package is by using `PyPI`.\n"
msgstr "Cara paling mudah untuk menginstal package `qiskit-addon-obp` adalah dengan `PyPI`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"option-2\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option 2: Install from source {#option-2-install-from-source}"
msgstr "Opsi 2: Instal dari source {#option-2-install-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Users who want to develop in the repository or run the notebooks locally might want to install from source.\n"
msgstr "Pengguna yang ingin mengembangkan di dalam repositori atau menjalankan notebook secara lokal mungkin ingin menginstal dari source.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If so, the first step is to clone the `qiskit-addon-obp` repository.\n"
msgstr "Kalau begitu, langkah pertama adalah meng-clone repositori `qiskit-addon-obp`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, upgrade pip and enter the repository.\n"
msgstr "Selanjutnya, upgrade pip dan masuk ke repositori.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to install `qiskit-addon-obp` to the virtual environment. If you plan on running the notebooks, install the notebook dependencies so you can run visualizations. If you plan on developing in the repository, you might want to install the `dev` dependencies.\n"
msgstr "Langkah berikutnya adalah menginstal `qiskit-addon-obp` ke virtual environment. Kalau kamu berencana menjalankan notebook, instal dependensi notebook supaya bisa menjalankan visualisasi. Kalau kamu berencana mengembangkan di repositori, mungkin kamu perlu menginstal dependensi `dev`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust the options below to suit your needs.\n"
msgstr "Sesuaikan opsi di bawah ini dengan kebutuhanmu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you installed the notebook dependencies, you can get started by running the notebooks in the docs directory.\n"
msgstr "Kalau kamu sudah menginstal dependensi notebook, kamu bisa mulai dengan menjalankan notebook di direktori docs.\n"
